  "description": "Roslyn source generator for DRPC — a distributed RPC library for .NET that runs over reliable UDP. Scans hub classes for [RemoteProcedure] contracts and emits the entire RPC plumbing at build time: typed async client stubs ({Method}Async), incoming dispatch with {Method}_Implementation hooks, connection wiring (ConnectAsync / ListenAsync), and flat payload encoding — you never write transport or serialization code. Contract mistakes such as duplicate method ids, unsupported signatures, or undeclared generic arguments surface as DRPCGEN compile-time diagnostics. Reference it as an analyzer (OutputItemType=\"Analyzer\" ReferenceOutputAssembly=\"false\") in every project that declares or implements a hub. Targets netstandard2.0.",
